f20f&oh=00_AQSBfkKh5ioQD2fAhsfbIXaRROrWPA8iwlRS1s5XXiOPsw&oe=6AFDC365"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape.png", "id": "23982655051399107", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820548_23982655058065773_1175559102631830755_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bj_Obsr9LL0Q7kNvwGj29RF&_nc_oc=Adq8S9KswNB-mX3Ff5CFuywywa2X78Z7iMXIcxsZIyHmOo2VvDYmrP5GfEpRIZIFtbU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQFxZ1Ne75Ca00tBDVU7cGY2nEU9nvqZVXrLxhFh5NXyQ&oe=6AFDB33D"}, "display_name": "Hands-On! Solitaire", "keywords": ["Solitaire", "cards", "poker"], "long_description": "# Hands-On! Solitaire \u2013 A New Way to Play Klondike Solitaire!\n\nExperience the timeless game of Klondike Solitaire in a whole new dimension! **Hands-On! Solitaire** brings classic solitaire gameplay into **fully immersive VR**, giving you the freedom to naturally **pick up, move, and place cards with your hands**\u2014just like in real life.\n\n## \u2666\ufe0f **Authentic Klondike Solitaire**\nClassic Klondike, just as you remember it\u2014now in VR. Enjoy every flip and win with faithful rules, **natural hand-tracked controls**, and **immersive environments**.{722022503792751}\n\n## \ud83d\udc50 **True Hand-Tracking Support**\nNo controllers needed! **Pick up, move, and place cards with your own hands** using **full hand-tracking** technology. Enjoy intuitive interactions that make every deal and shuffle feel effortless.{1021443566738391}\n\n## \ud83c\udf3f **6 Immersive Environments**\nFind your perfect atmosphere with **6 beautifully crafted immersive environments**. Whether its flying high above the Grand Canyon or viewing a spectacular Aurora Borealis light show, you can adapt your playing experience to fit your mood.{1673197654085645}\n\n## \ud83c\udfe1 **Full Passthrough Experience**\nBring solitaire into your own living space! With **full passthrough**, your cards blend seamlessly into your surroundings, making gameplay feel more natural than ever.\n\nWhat are you waiting for? Step into *Hands-On! Solitaire* and **rediscover the joy of solitaire\u2014completely in virtual reality!**", "short_description": "Experience Klondike Solitaire like never before\u2014fully immersive, fully hands-on! Pick up, move, and place cards naturally with complete hand-tracking support. Play in 6 immersive environments or your living room with the passthrough experience. Classic gameplay meets cutting-edge VR\u2014are you ready to play? \u2665\ufe0f\u2660\ufe0f\u2666\ufe0f\u2663\ufe0f"}]}, "developer_name": "Yonuel Interactive", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://yonuelinteractive.com/games/hands-on-solitaire/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://yonuelinteractive.com/games/hands-on-solitaire/terms/", "publisher_name": "Yonuel Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://yonuelinteractive.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25293125020284100"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295543_1219402126643527_8129877324462773257_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P_F6hQArd2EQ7kNvwFp4RSb&_nc_oc=AdoRxnJ0YxVRSv3pl1GEfSVPERDnf9eRAs8VQB2eV9mgDiE5WtWO